WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.900
TextEdit is in front. Behind it, the agent reads an email in Gmail. On screen: "Books a meeting behind your app".

00:02.900 --> 00:04.170
A picture-in-picture card appears in the corner with a live view of the agent's window.

00:04.170 --> 00:06.770
The agent types a quick event into Calendar. On screen: "Creates the event in Calendar".

00:06.770 --> 00:09.370
The new event, "Launch sync with Jordan", Oct 27, 2:00 to 2:30 PM.

00:09.370 --> 00:11.670
The agent clicks Add Reminder, and the Reminders card comes forward.

00:11.670 --> 00:14.470
It adds "Prep launch slides". On screen: "Adds the reminder in Reminders".

00:14.470 --> 00:19.000
The agent finishes after working in 2 windows. The view pulls back: TextEdit stayed in front, with 0 front-app changes, 0 window raises and 0 pointer moves.

00:19.000 --> 00:21.800
Same task, two models, both sped up 44 times. Claude Opus 5.5 finishes in 52.7 s. GPT-6.1 Sol finishes in 1 min 27.7 s. TextEdit stays in front for both.

00:21.800 --> 00:24.800
On screen: "Any model, working in the background".
